Usage:
  ./presswarden fast [target]          High-signal routine audit
  ./presswarden full [target]          Comprehensive audit + deep integrity/DB maintenance
  ./presswarden incident [target]      Evidence-first compromise / reinfection investigation
  ./presswarden db [target]            Database security/malware audit + LiteSpeed/native maintenance
  ./presswarden litespeed-db status [target|--target target]    Show verified LiteSpeed database status
  ./presswarden litespeed-db optimize [target|--target target]  Run verified LiteSpeed database maintenance
  ./presswarden litespeed AREA ACTION ... [target|--target target]  Full LiteSpeed Cache CLI management
  ./presswarden scan [target]          Alias for fast
  ./presswarden inspect KIND [target]  Focused read-only PHP/JS/DB recheck (php|js|db|runtime)
  ./presswarden update               Update PressWarden code + threat intelligence
  ./presswarden intel ACTION [target]  status|update|scan threat intelligence
  ./presswarden baseline ACTION [target]  create|status|diff security baseline
  ./presswarden changes [target]       Compare current state with the saved baseline
